      <p>You must submit your renewal application to the Oficina de Extranjería (Immigration Office) in the province where you are registered as a resident. Each autonomous community manages these offices.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">How to Locate Your Office</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Visit: <a href="https://www.inclusion.gob.es/">www.inclusion.gob.es</a> - National Immigration Office website</li>
        <li>Search by your autonomous community and city</li>
        <li>Offices are typically found in provincial capitals</li>
